    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir15">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e98">Caput 15</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e102">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_3@8-9">Aqua sapientiae.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir15-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir15-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e113">gratia Spiritus sancti: unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e115" source="http://scta.info/resource/io4_14@2-14">Qui biberit aquam quam ego dabo vobis, <pb ed="#P" n="1199B"/> fiet in eo fons aquae salientis in vitam aeternam<!-- check: Migne cites io14; text matches io4_14 --></quote>, id est non cedet persecutioni, vel haereticae pravitati.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e124">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e126">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e128">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e130" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_5@1-4">Et in medio Ecclesiae.</quote>
            Apostolos, praedicatores Evangelii significat, quos Dei sapientia, id est Christus, Ecclesiae praeposuit.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e135">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e137">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e139">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e141" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_7@1-2">Homines stulti,</quote>
            etc. Pagani, et idololatrae et Judaei, qui crucifigunt Filium Dei, sequentes umbram legis, et respuentes veritatem Evangelii: vel haeretici, qui Scripturas pervertunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e146">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e148">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e150">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e152" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_8@7-9">Et viri veraces.</quote>
            Omnis qui est ex veritate, audit vocem meam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e158">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e160">Versus 9</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e162">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e164" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_9@5-7">In ore peccatoris.</quote>
            Haereticorum, qui doctrinam Patrum despiciunt, et simplices decipiunt. Donum largitatis non invidet Deus alicui, qui <pb ed="#P" n="1199C"/> vult omnes homines salvos fieri.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e171">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e173">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e175">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e177" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_12@1-2">Non dicas.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir15-Rd1e180"><name xml:id="gom-sir15-Nd1e181" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e184">Non sunt mala nostra Deo imputanda, cui non sunt necessaria: <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e186" source="http://scta.info/resource/iac1_13@9-13">Deus intentator malorum est</quote>.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e192">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e194">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e196">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e198" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_14@4-5">Constituit hominem</quote>
            ad imaginem et similitudinem suam, et liberum arbitrium dedit ei.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e203">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e205">Versus 16</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e207">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e209" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_16@1-2">Si volueris.</quote>
            Id est si volueris implere opera et mandata Dei, habebis consolationem: si contempseris gehennae ardorem.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e214">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e216">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e218">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_19@1-3">Quoniam multa sapientia.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir15-Rd1e223"><name xml:id="gom-sir15-Nd1e224" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e227"><seg type="qs">Nullus potest praescientiam Dei</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">nihil faciat homo, nisi quod dignum sit conspectui divino.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir15-Dd1e236">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir15-Hd1e238">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir15-d1e240">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e242" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir15_21@1-2">Nemini mandavit.</quote>
            Non est auctor Deus peccandi, nec spatium concedit in quo homo <pb ed="#P" n="1199D"/> impune peccare possit; semper bona praecipit, et mala interdicit. Solummodo placet ei quod bonum est, infidelitas autem et inutilitas displicet, <quote xml:id="gom-sir15-Qd1e247" source="http://scta.info/resource/ps10_8@1-6">quoniam justus Deus, et justitias dilexit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
